sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Reseller
    participant Cab as Cabinet (apps/merchant)
    participant API as p2p.cabinet_routes
    participant Svc as p2p.reservations
    participant Bank as Humo / @HUMOcardbot
    participant TG as Telegram Business bot
    participant WH as POST /webhooks/telegram/p2p
    participant In as p2p.intake
    participant Dep as merchants.deposit.credit_deposit
    participant DB as Postgres

    R->>Cab: amount in som
    Cab->>API: POST /merchant/cabinet/p2p/deposits + Idempotency-Key
    API->>Svc: reserve(merchant, amount)
    Svc->>DB: INSERT reservation (unique open amount per card, bump +1..+99)
    API-->>Cab: number, exact amount, card, expires_at (5 min), amount_usd
    R->>Bank: transfers the exact amount
    Bank->>TG: credit notification (via the owner's Telegram)
    TG->>WH: business_message + X-Telegram-Bot-Api-Secret-Token
    WH->>WH: compare_digest(secret) before reading the body
    WH->>In: ingest_update(update)
    In->>In: sender and chat are the HUMO bot, not forwarded
    In->>DB: INSERT journal row (unique connection + message id)
    In->>DB: lock reservation FOR UPDATE (amount, last4, bank time in window)
    In->>Dep: credit amount_usd, key p2p:{reservation.id}
    In->>DB: reservation paid, journal matched
    WH-->>TG: 200
    loop every 3 s
        Cab->>API: GET /merchant/cabinet/p2p/deposits/{number}
        API-->>Cab: status
    end
    Cab-->>R: Credited
